# Production build config for GitHub Pages (https://nikfuz.github.io/billmint/).
# GitHub Pages has no runtime env vars: VITE_* values are baked in at BUILD time,
# so after editing this file you must rebuild + redeploy:  npm run deploy
#
# A Stripe Payment Link URL (https://buy.stripe.com/...) is meant to be public, so it is
# safe to commit here. NEVER put secret keys (sk_live_..., rk_live_...) in any VITE_* var.
#
# Empty = no checkout: the Upgrade button says "Pro checkout opens soon" and nothing unlocks Pro.
VITE_STRIPE_PAYMENT_LINK=
